note: Budget + Autonomy Contract draft domain (A1_19). Constitutional boundary identical to A1_18 (SpecPackage): BudgetContractStatus has EXACTLY {draft, awaitingRatification} — NO ratified case (type-level enforcement, CaseIterable.allCases.count==2 test). budgetHash = SHA256 over limits+autonomy (sortedKeys canonical JSON, excludes status/projectId — same pattern as specHash in A1_18). BudgetContractBuilder.buildEnvelope() wraps A1_23 ApprovalEnvelopeBuilder with signatureNode=2; pure, deterministic, zero tape writes. BudgetProjections: budgetDraftCard (uses A1_15 BudgetCardPayload) + projectReadyPendingCard — both derive_source non-empty, schema_version non-empty, deterministic ×2. BudgetContractValidator: rejects tokenLimit<=0, wallClockSecs<=0, empty projectId, etc. 17 new tests (211→228, MIN_TESTS updated). First shipgate attempt: gate 16 probe timed out (transient — residual turingosd PID 23523 from earlier app launch caused system load; killed daemon, retried, PASS). Manual probe confirmed binary works (exit 0, WorktreeDiscovered envelope received).

Predicate coverage:
  P1: BudgetContractStatus.allCases.count==2, no rawValue "ratified" or "activated" ✓
  P2: budgetHash determinism ×2; content change→different hash; status/projectId change→stable hash ✓
  P3: Builder signatureNode==2; budgetHash matches contract.budgetHash (sha256: prefix) ✓
  P4: Projection determinism ×2; derive_source non-empty; schema_version non-empty ✓
  P5: Validator accepts valid; rejects tokenLimit=0; rejects wallClockSecs=-1; rejects empty projectId ✓
  P6: T3 hostThreatLevel → BuildRefusal.hostThreatLevelT3NotSupported forwarded from A1_23 ✓
  P6 (MIN_TESTS): 228 tests, 0 failures ✓

